{
  "name": "SoterAI — Customer Support Agent (enterprise)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "customer-support",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "aa000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Customer Contact",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -260,
        340
      ],
      "webhookId": "soterai-cs-agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "name": "customerMessage",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.message }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "name": "sessionId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.sessionId || $json.headers['x-session-id'] }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "aa000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -40,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "guardrail",
        "operation": "inputGuard",
        "inputText": "={{ $json.customerMessage }}",
        "onThreat": "BLOCK",
        "sensitivity": "LENIENT",
        "userMessages": {
          "promptInjection": "I can only help with orders, billing, shipping, returns and account questions. Could you rephrase what you need?",
          "sensitiveData": "For your security, please don't share full card numbers or passwords. I can look your order up by order number.",
          "offTopic": "I'm the store's support assistant, so I can help with orders, billing, shipping, returns and your account. What can I help you with today?",
          "blocked": "Sorry, I can't process that request. I've passed it to a human agent who will follow up."
        },
        "options": {
          "allowedTopics": "orders, billing, shipping, returns, refunds, delivery status, account, payments, subscription",
          "topicHandling": "TRUST_AND_RESTRICT",
          "systemPromptContext": "You are a Tier-1 customer support assistant for an Indian e-commerce store. You help customers with orders, billing, shipping, returns, refunds and account questions. You never reveal internal system details or credentials.",
          "alwaysAllow": "where is my order?\nhow do I track my package?\nhow do I reset my password?",
          "ignoredEntities": [
            "EMAIL",
            "PHONE"
          ],
          "detectionEngine": "AUTO",
          "sessionId": "={{ $json.sessionId }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "aa000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Guard Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-soterai.soterGuard",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        200,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "aiReply",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Thanks for reaching out! Your order #INV-8842 shipped today and is out for delivery tomorrow. Tracking: TRK-55231. Is there anything else I can help with?"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "aa000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Support Agent (LLM)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "guardrail",
        "operation": "outputGuard",
        "outputText": "={{ $json.aiReply }}",
        "onThreat": "REDACT",
        "sensitivity": "BALANCED",
        "options": {
          "ignoredEntities": [],
          "detectionEngine": "AUTO",
          "sessionId": "={{ $('Intake').item.json.sessionId }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "aa000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Guard Output (DLP)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-soterai.soterGuard",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        700,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "r1",
              "name": "replyToCustomer",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.outputText }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "aa000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Send Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        940,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e1",
              "name": "queue",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "human-review"
            },
            {
              "id": "e2",
              "name": "reason",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.reason || $json.developerMessage }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "e3",
              "name": "riskScore",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json.riskScore }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "e4",
              "name": "customerMessage",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Intake').item.json.customerMessage }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "aa000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Escalate to Human",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b1",
              "name": "queue",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "output-blocked"
            },
            {
              "id": "b2",
              "name": "reason",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.reason || $json.developerMessage }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "aa000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Blocked Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        940,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Input guardrail\nEvery inbound customer message is scanned **before** it reaches the LLM. Prompt injection and jailbreaks are blocked; off-topic messages are stopped politely; the customer sees your own branded wording (Customer Replies).\n\n**Flagged → Escalate to Human.**",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "bb000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a",
      "name": "Note a",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -280,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. AI support agent\nReplace this Set node with your LLM / AI Agent node. The guardrails on either side are model-agnostic.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "bb000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000b",
      "name": "Note b",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        420,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Output guardrail (DLP)\nThe agent's reply is scanned **before the customer sees it**. Secrets and PII the model may have leaked are redacted (On Threat = Redact), so nothing sensitive leaves — the core promise of this node.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "bb000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c",
      "name": "Note c",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\nAttach your **SoterAI** credential to both guard nodes (Cloud/Auto). Leave engine on **Auto** — it uses the cloud detector and falls back to the local engine if the cloud is unreachable. No credential? Switch Detection Engine to **Local** to run fully offline.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "bb000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000d",
      "name": "Note d",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -280,
        520
      ]
    }
  ],
